    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94801" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκηπήϊον:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτύον</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκηπήνιον:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βακτηρία, τρίαινα, βάκτρον,
				κηρύκ&lt;ε&gt;<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιον</span>,
